    "sub_name": "性別平等與親密關係",
    "sub_ename": "GENDER EQUALITY AND INTIMATE RELATIONSHIP",
    "describe_ch": "希望透過此課程讓學生理解性別平等意識的重要，及其實質的內容與意涵，並透過對於親密關係之各種樣態和實務議題的討論，以達到尊重個體、理解差異、自我保護與不傷害他人為最高指導原則。",
    "describe_eh": "Through this course, students will understand the importance of gender equality and its substance and meaning. Through the discussion and practical issues of intimacy. The course guiding principle is to respect the individual, understand the difference, protect the self and not harm others.",
